# Documented, reviewed exceptions only — never a blanket severity downgrade.
#
# All 15 CVEs below are the SAME root cause: a stale Go toolchain baked
# into `gosu`, a tiny privilege-drop helper bundled in the official
# postgres:16-alpine image (docker-entrypoint.sh execs it once, briefly,
# at container startup to switch root -> postgres). gosu makes no
# outbound network/TLS connections of its own, so this stdlib's
# TLS/net/url/x509 CVEs have effectively no real attack surface in this
# deployment. Confirmed (2026-08-11) present across every current
# postgres:16-alpine* tag (16-alpine, 16-alpine3.22/.23/.24) — not
# something a different tag pin fixes; needs docker-library/postgres to
# rebuild gosu against a patched Go compiler. Re-evaluate at every
# review — delete once the upstream image picks up a fix, don't let this
# list grow forever without re-checking whether it's still needed.
